+     * inside the clip range: Lamborghini's rear view looks backwards by
+     * negating the projection, so the test point of every car in the mirror
+     * view comes out with w < 0 and screen x/y/z where they belong. Rejected,
+     * every such test reported 0 and the cars vanished whenever the player
+     * looked behind. */
+    if (p[3] == 0.0f || p[0] != p[0] || p[1] != p[1] || p[2] != p[2]
