+ *
+ * The microcode's fields were extracted for every instruction of every
+ * vertex: a dozen shifts and masks per source, three sources an
+ * instruction, for programs run tens of millions of times a second. The
+ * program from the start slot to its FINAL flag is decoded once instead,
+ * whenever program memory or the start slot changes, into the same fields
+ * the loop below used to compute. nv2a_vsh_prepare() decodes ahead of a
+ * parallel batch so worker threads only ever read it. */
